{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Math Middle &amp; High School PRO 是一款針對中學數學的計算與解題工具，適合學生自學並核對解題步驟，也方便家長與教師快速驗算。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-7.webp\">\n<h2>逐步詳解每個計算步驟</h2>\n<p>App 涵蓋數論、分數、代數、幾何、三角函數、指數、對數、立體幾何與統計等課題；只要選擇題型並輸入數值，即可取得逐行解說，複雜概念另附圖形與動畫輔助理解。程式支援負數、小數、分數與 π，並可儲存及分享計算結果；漏填或錯誤數值會被標示說明，計算自動存入歷史，隨時排序、刪除或重算，全程沒有廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-79-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-80-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-81-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-82-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Math Middle &amp; High School PRO</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.457665+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:47:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T23:57:47.159307+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:04.014414+00:00","content_hash":"6067a20ddba24a8aa052dc924605ce053d45017634d0370e166d6f127576becc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}